[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3907580136","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-3907580136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":3907580136,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7o6PDo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T10:09:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T10:09:49Z","body":"Do you have some benchmarks for the improvements? See [contributing optimizations](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/optimization.html)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3907580136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923692669","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-3923692669","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":3923692669,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7p3sx9","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T23:13:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T21:39:55Z","body":"Benchmark:\r\n[benchmark-dotnet-ctor-tramps.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25401871/benchmark-dotnet-ctor-tramps.zip)\r\n\r\nRequires the following patch:\r\n[add-toggle-flag-for-benchmark.patch](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25427869/add-toggle-flag-for-benchmark.patch)\r\n\r\nResults:\r\n```\r\n| Method                      | Mean     | Error     | StdDev    | Allocated |\r\n|---------------------------- |---------:|----------:|----------:|----------:|\r\n| CreateGodotObjectWithTramps | 6.934 ms | 0.0024 ms | 0.0021 ms |     847 B |\r\n| CreateGodotObjectWithLegacy | 6.936 ms | 0.0029 ms | 0.0026 ms |    1002 B |\r\n```\r\n\r\nActual time for creating a GodotObject seems unchanged. The constructor dispatch logic likely adds very little to the whole thing. I don't know how to benchmark just the constructor dispatching while skipping/ignoring the actual construction. At least this proves it's not slower.\r\n\r\nThe noticeable difference is in allocated managed memory, as a result of no longer doing reflection operations, which aside from being slower also involved additional allocations.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923692669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4088886214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-4088886214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":4088886214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zt3PG","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T09:35:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T09:35:10Z","body":"Invoking things via `UnsafeAccessor` also generally helps with the robustness of the `PublishAot = true`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4088886214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4247035448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-4247035448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":4247035448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79JJ44","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T20:46:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T20:46:27Z","body":"Fixed a regression in exported games that was caused by LightmapperRD using the wrong API level (see #118584). The workaround was to move all trampolines to the generated file instead of placing them on each class. This is better any way, because we shouldn't be calling the static constructor of all classes during initialization (as it's very expensive, unless we change static fields to be lazily initialized).\r\n\r\nStill marked as draft, as this depends on the other PR.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4247035448/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5376916489","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-5376916489","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":5376916489,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQH08CQ","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-22T00:58:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T00:58:26Z","body":"I tried to make this into a stacked PR, but it seems that only works with branches on the origin repository. What a useless feature and what a waste of time.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5376916489/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907288302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-5907288302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":5907288302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYBoQ7g","user":{"login":"cdd1037","id":54396314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzk2MzE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54396314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037","html_url":"https://github.com/cdd1037","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:05Z","body":"While testing a 4.7.2 backport of this PR, I hit CS0117 for a script class whose only constructor takes a managed-only argument, such as System.IO.Stream.\r\n\r\nThe constructor is filtered out as not Variant-compatible, so ScriptMethodsGenerator omits GetGodotConstructorTrampolines. However, TrampolineCollectorDispatchGenerator still generates a call to that method, breaking an otherwise valid C# class.\r\n\r\nCould the generator emit an empty constructor collector when no eligible constructors exist, or consistently skip the corresponding dispatch? Constructors used only from C# shouldn’t need Variant-compatible parameters.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907288302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907579630","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-5907579630","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":5907579630,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYB6C7g","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T08:45:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T08:45:45Z","body":"> for a script class whose only constructor takes a managed-only argument, such as System.IO.Stream.\r\n\r\nIf I remember correctly, every script type must have a parameterless constructor, and a parameter-only script type isn't supported. Constructing these unsupported types on the C# side is undefined behavior, and the fact that it works is purely a coincidence.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907579630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907954815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-5907954815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":5907954815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYCQ8fw","user":{"login":"cdd1037","id":54396314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzk2MzE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54396314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037","html_url":"https://github.com/cdd1037","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdd1037/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T09:08:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T09:08:39Z","body":"> > for a script class whose only constructor takes a managed-only argument, such as System.IO.Stream.\n> \n> If I remember correctly, every script type must have a parameterless constructor, and a parameter-only script type isn't supported. Constructing these unsupported types on the C# side is undefined behavior, and the fact that it works is purely a coincidence.\n\nThat makes sense, thanks for clarifying. This seems better framed as a diagnostic improvement rather than a regression in supported usage. An explicit message about the missing parameterless constructor would be clearer than CS0117 in generated code.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907954815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5908003893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-5908003893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":5908003893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYCT8NQ","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T09:11:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T09:11:25Z","body":"> An explicit message about the missing parameterless constructor would be clearer than CS0117 in generated code.\r\n\r\nTotally agree; Godot.Net is generally quite vague about what it doesn't support, but can compile if someone happens to write it out.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5908003893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5908033267","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116301#issuecomment-5908033267","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116301","id":5908033267,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYCVu8w","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T09:13:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T09:15:36Z","body":"Parameter-only script is supported in GDScript, so C# not supporting it would be strange. Well if we ignore that `[Tool]` scripts needs parameterless ctor to be reloadable, it should work in other scenarious.\r\n\r\nYou only required to have them if it is a node type stored in the `PackedScene` or a saved resource type.","author_associa